- goal: Characterize /temperance marker format fits /build flow (cli#328 finding 6)
- scope-decision: Right thing — one driver asserts marker shape (path + body format + commit path) auditably fails when `.gitignore` blocks state/markers/, auditably passes when adopter's gitignore keeps markers tracked. Right way — Beck RED-first; pre-cure fixture has gitignored path (RED on git-add silence); post-cure fixture has tracked path (GREEN).
